  "description": "Protect your wheel wells with OEDRO fender flares—designed to guard against mud, scratches, and sand. The sleek, unique vent design helps reduce driving resistance by channeling airflow out from both sides, ensuring both style and performance on the road.\nFeatures\nRust Resistant. These fender flares are finished with a unique powder coat finish. E-coat applied to the carbon steel with a rust-resistant layer.\nSolid Welded Steel. Featured with a narrower width and tangent surface design, OEDRO fenders are constructed with durable steel to protect your Wrangler from debris and mud in the off-road trail.\nDetachable Decors. Detachable and paintable red trim satisfied your personalized requirements. Redesign your car as what you like.\nFront & Rear Full Protection. OEDRO fender flares can completely protect wheel wells' outer damage.\nDurable & Long-lasting. Fender flares are also powder-coated with a black textured finish and enhanced by pre-treatment to provide extreme resistance against rust and wear.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation recommended for safety.\nFitment\nFits for 2007-2018 Jeep Wrangler JK & JK Unlimited 2-Door & 4-Door All Models",
